{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は握手会だったよ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに2部制で\n服をお着替えしました..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部めは、\nすっごいガーリーに春っぽく。\nブラウスの刺繍がポイントなのに見えてない。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blouse: vannie\nskirt: merryjenny"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部めの髪型にしたあとに\n写真とっちゃったけど\n本当は巻き下ろしに三つ編み垂らしてたよ。\nvannieってブランドが最近大好きで...全部集めたくなっちゃう。Gジャンもバッグもブラウスもかわいい...."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このコーデ詳しくは今月のPopteenみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部めは、\n中華風ワンピ。\n髪型はハーフの中華団子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近のお気に入りワンピース\n鮮やかで綺麗な色とデザインなの\nお目立ちワンピ....着やすい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪色、数日前に\n春色に染めました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいてくれる方いて嬉しかった(｡•ㅅ•｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バースデーライブのお話や\n早めの誕生日お祝いしていただいたり\nあと奈々未のファンの方がとても来てびっくり\n仲良しだからって律儀に挨拶にきてくださった^_^\n川後チョップも沢山したから\n初めましていっぱいいたってことかな？うれしいな〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと\nアナと雪の女王のスノーギースのペンライトと\nメガネ持ってきたから、\nたまにメガネつけたり\nペンライト付けてケチャしてファンの人と遊んでた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと\n特製あみだくじ作ってた\nあまり気付かれなくてこれやった人あまり居ないけど。(｡•ㅅ•｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次シングルは\nもっと沢山のかたにきて欲しいな...♡\nもし気になったらぜひ....m(__)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部数増えたので\nみんなくるか心配だ〜〜>_<"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど\n握手すきだからたのしみ！！！♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなと楽しい話しようね。！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまた来週も握手あるので\n来週もたのしみ！₍˄·͈༝·͈˄₎◞ෆ⃛̑̑ෆ⃛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2017/03/05/4075349/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントも\nいつも有難うございます！\nちゃんと読んでます(｡•ㅅ•｡)♡\n本当に嬉しいんだよ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では\nばいぴち！"}],"source":"archive"}